Z||000000||mblackwell||06-08-2001||02:32 PM||||Now you will see why I needed painting advice.<P>My car is an '88 formula with the following stuff installed.<P>Power locks<BR>Keyless entry/alarm<BR>Power decklid release<BR>Tilt wheel<BR>Cruise control<BR>Sunroof<BR>A/C (doesn't work)<BR>CD/casette<BR>Automatic<P>Plans for future.<P>Paint<BR>Fix temp gauge<BR>Suspension<BR>Seat covers.<P>Here she is.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/front1.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/front2.JPG">  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/driver_side_ext_small.jpg"> <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rear_good.JPG">  <P>Notice the temp guage, uh-oh.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/steering_wheel_1.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mid-dash.JPG">  <P>Well, what do you think?<BR><p>[This message has been edited by mblackwell (edited 06-08-2001).]||||reg||1
